<title>UK: Rabobank sets warrants on Pro Sieben Media.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets warrants on Pro Sieben Media.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rabobank Deutschland AG said it has issued a total of 12.5 million American-style call and put warrants in five equal tranches on shares of Pro Sieben Media AG.</p>
<p>EXERCISE PERIOD 09.JUL.97-30.DEC.98</p>
<p> PAYDATE	09.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE	ISSUE	 PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	77 DEM	3.48 DEM    18.0 PCT     4.6 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT B	77 DEM	2.20 DEM    17.5 PCT     7.3 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL C	85 DEM	2.95 DEM    24.7 PCT     5.4 TIMES</p>
<p>  PUT D	70 DEM	1.74 DEM    23.4 PCT     9.2 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL E     110 DEM	1.66 DEM    47.9 PCT     9.6 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
